  "description": "A light Firefox theme inspired by Rio de Janeiro, featuring tropical greens, sunny warmth, and fresh vibrant accents.",
  "author": "Codigrate",
  "homepage_url": "https://codigrate.com/theme?product=rio-de-janeiro&category=cities",
